  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "Scope: The question asks for the raw difference in conversion rates (email minus paid_search). The answer reports a standardized, adjusted difference instead of the requested raw difference.",
    "Grounding: The standardized conversion rates (0.2528 and 0.3807) and the adjusted difference (-0.1279) are not present in the printed output; only the raw rates (0.374648 and 0.300557) are shown.",
    "Overreach: The answer makes a causal claim that the email campaign “did not improve conversion,” despite the data being observational and the channel not being randomized."
  ]
}
